# BindingWM — Studie-BWM-1

This dataset contains fMRI data for the BindingWM study (Studie-BWM-1),
investigating feature binding in visual working memory.

Subjects: 20 healthy adults
Sessions: 4 per subject (ses-01 to ses-04)
Tasks:
  - task-bwm       (binding working memory task)

Data were acquired on a Siemens Prisma 3T scanner at Cooperative Brain Imaging Center (CoBIC) in Frankfurt, Germany.